---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="C-TPAT Audit & Supply Chain Security Services | Eurocert"
  description="C-TPAT audit and supply chain security support covering minimum security criteria, validation readiness, documentation and corrective actions."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/ctpat/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783747209/0912abda-9285-4279-8a36-e9b196d8af45_sxju2a.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="C-TPAT Customs-Trade Partnership Against Terrorism"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Voluntary Supply Chain Security Program by U.S. Customs &amp; Border Protection</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">C-TPAT  -  <span class="text-eurogold-400">Customs-Trade Partnership Against Terrorism</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Strengthen your supply chain security, reduce inspections, and improve border clearance with the CBP partnership program</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Program Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">C-TPAT?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) listened to the recommendations made by the Advisory Committee on Commercial Operations (COAC), which encouraged the creation of the C-TPAT Exporter Entity. CBP introduced an exporter entity to C-TPAT to support export growth and increase the competitiveness of the U.S. business community, as outlined by President Obama&#x27;s National Export Initiative.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">CBP is also interested in providing the U.S. business community with benefits currently enjoyed by foreign importers through Mutual Recognition Arrangements (MRA). This is an opportunity to align with the programs of foreign customs under the World Customs Organization&#x27;s (WCO) Framework of Standards to Secure and Facilitate Global Trade (SAFE Framework).</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">How C-TPAT Works</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">When an entity joins C-TPAT, an agreement is made to work with CBP to protect the supply chain, identify security gaps, and implement specific security measures and best practices. Applicants must address a broad range of security topics and present security profiles that list action plans to align security throughout the supply chain. <strong class="text-slate-700">C-TPAT members are considered to be of low risk</strong>, and are therefore less likely to be examined at a U.S. port of entry.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367934/eurocert/b9.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="C-TPAT Customs-Trade Partnership"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Risk Assessment</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">The Five Step <span class="text-euro-600">Risk Assessment Process</span></h2></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-5"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">01</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Map Cargo/Data Flow</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Map cargo/data flow and control, identify business partners (directly or indirectly contracted) and how cargo moves throughout the supply chain including modes of transportation (air, sea, rail, or truck) and nodes (country of origin, transit points).</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-5"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">02</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Conduct Threat Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Focus on Terrorism, Contraband Smuggling, Human Smuggling, Agricultural and Public Safety Threats, Organized Crime, and conditions in a country/region which may foster such threats, and rank those threats.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-5"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">03</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Conduct Vulnerability Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">In accordance with C-TPAT Minimum Security Criteria  -  identify what the Partner has that a terrorist or criminal might desire (data, access to cargo, company information), then identify weaknesses in procedures that would allow access.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-5"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">04</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Prepare Written Action Plan</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Address vulnerabilities with mechanisms to record identified weaknesses, who is responsible for addressing the issues, and due dates. Report results to appropriate company officials and employees on completed follow up and changes.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-5"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">05</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Document the Procedure</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Document how risk assessments are conducted, including reviewing and revising the procedure periodically. The process should be reviewed and updated at least annually, and a Risk Assessment should be conducted and documented at least annually.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Understanding Validation</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">C-TPAT <span class="text-eurogold-400">Validation FAQs</span></h3></div><div class="space-y-5"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-question text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">What is a C-TPAT Validation?</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">A C-TPAT validation is a process through which the U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) C-TPAT program meets with company representatives and visits selected domestic and foreign sites to verify supply chain security measures contained in the C-TPAT participant&#x27;s security profile are accurate and are being followed.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-bullseye text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">What is the Goal of a C-TPAT Validation?</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">The principal goal for CBP is to ensure that the company&#x27;s C-TPAT security profile is reliable, accurate, and effective. However, validations also provide a forum through which CBP and a C-TPAT participant can build a stronger partnership by discussing supply chain security issues, sharing &quot;best practices,&quot; and cooperatively developing solutions to address potential vulnerabilities. The face-to-face nature encourages both CBP and the C-TPAT participant to better understand the role each plays in securing borders against international terrorism.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-not-equal text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">Is a C-TPAT Validation an Audit?</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-eurogold-400">No.</strong> A validation is not an audit. Whereas CBP routinely performs audits in a variety of operational and regulatory areas (e.g. trade compliance, NAFTA), C-TPAT validations do not measure a company&#x27;s adherence to existing government rules and regulations. Instead, the validation is focused on the verification of supply chain security processes and procedures that a company voluntarily agrees to verify or perform under the auspices of the C-TPAT program.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Updated Requirements</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">C-TPAT <span class="text-euro-600">New Criteria</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-user-shield text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Management Commitment to a Culture of Security</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-laptop-code text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Cyber Security and Protection from Social Engineering Threats</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-seedling text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Agricultural Security</h4></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-money-bill-wave text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Prevention of Money Laundering and Terrorism Financing</h4></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Membership Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of C-TPAT <span class="text-euro-600">Membership</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">C-TPAT Validation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Achieve validated status through U.S. Customs &amp; Border Protection partnership.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-search text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply Chain Security Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive assessment of your supply chain security practices and vulnerabilities.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-cogs text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Security Best Practices</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Implement robust security controls and best practices across your supply chain.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shipping-fast text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Faster Customs Clearance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Reduce delays and expedite customs processing at the border.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-double text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Reduced Inspections</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">C-TPAT members are considered low risk and less likely to be examined at U.S. ports of entry.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-star text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Priority CBP Processing</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Receive priority processing for your shipments through CBP.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-flag-usa text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Front-of-Line Status</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Front-of-line status at U.S. border crossings for faster movement of goods.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Enhanced Trade Partnership</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Strengthen your partnership with U.S. Customs &amp; Border Protection.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Audit Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Get Audited by <span class="text-eurogold-400">Eurocert?</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in supply chain security, CTPAT-style readiness and trade-facilitation risk controls.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">C-TPAT Expertise</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Eurocert Inspection Services provides methods, audits, and reviews to better manage and improve shipment-related data, and can help businesses achieve C-TPAT status. With a potential for fines, maintaining compliance is important.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">We perform supply chain security audits against all Customs-Trade Partnership Against Terrorism (C-TPAT) global and regional requirements, including the updated Minimum Security Requirements.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 mt-8 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="text-eurogold-400 font-bold">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A</span>  -  a Pan-European Certification body operating from Athens with global reach.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">ACCREDITED</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font"><a href="/accreditations/" class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Independent Third-Party Audits</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-100 shadow-xl"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0"><div class="p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-center"